{"name":"Surcharge of 1.00 for type INM, applied after the cap","category":"calculation","priority":"P0","statement":"When the operation type is \"INM\", a fixed 1.00 is added to the commission. The surcharge is added after the 5.00 cap, so an INM commission can reach 6.00.","condition":"tipo == \"INM\" (case-sensitive comparison)","action":"comision = comision + 1.00, after the cap has been applied"}

